«
@@ ============================================================
@@ TrackLen — length of a track on the WGS-84 ellipsoid, the sum of the
@@ geodesic distances between successive points, by VincentyInv.
@@ 
@@ Input : a list of at least two points, each { φ λ } or, as in a route,
@@         { "name" φ λ }. Plain numbers are degrees.
@@ Output: the length of the track.
@@ ============================================================

  → pts
  «
    IF pts SIZE 2 < THEN "A track needs at least two points" DOERR END
    0
    1 pts SIZE 1 - FOR kk
      pts kk GET DUP SIZE 1 - GET pts kk GET DUP SIZE GET
      pts kk 1 + GET DUP SIZE 1 - GET pts kk 1 + GET DUP SIZE GET
      ⓁVincentyInv DROP DROP 1_m CONVERT UVAL +
    NEXT
    1_m *
  »
»
